{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This is a ReaScript for REAPER that provides tools for cleaning up MIDI CC data. It removes redundant control change events and smooths selected CCs in the MIDI editor.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The tool provides a user interface for adjusting settings and applying CC cleanup operations to selected MIDI CCs in the MIDI editor.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This package contains scripts for applying legato effects to MIDI notes. In midi Action List search for: Legato_Tool - Advanced legato editing tool with UI Legato_Tool_Quick_Heal - Heal overlapping notes with default settings (no UI) Legato_Tool_Quick_Legato - Fill gaps between selected notes and add 10% legato (no UI) Legato_Tool_Quick_NonLegato - Remove legato effect and add small gaps between notes (no UI)\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
